      "content": "rebooting feels pointless. you can't patch something that was fundamentally broken at the kernel level. it's not even about fixing the errors anymore... it's just that the resource usage is too high for no reason. everything is just heavy and slow. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a system that crashed a long time ago.",
